WEBVTT

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:29.300
Rebel: Captain. She's highly trained. Deception. Infiltration. Extraction.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.280
Rebel: She's special forces.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.000
Captain: Iden Versio.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.520
Captain: Inferno Squad.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.220
Captain: **Commander** Versio.  You must be important.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:03.720
Captain: Look at me.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:14.540
Captain: So let's talk facts. That's what I'm here for. You have the activation code, I've got the ability to help you out.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.500
Captain: Just give me the code.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.340
Captain: You know we could really use someone like you.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.940
Captain: Just help me and I'll help you, it's that easy.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:39.520
Captain: I'm going to get what I want eventually. My best technicians are slicing into your droid right now.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:46.500
Captain: Think on my offer. All I want is the code.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:55.600
Captain: The Empire's time has come. You don't have to go down with it.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.120
Iden: You're right.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.560
Iden: The Empire's time has come.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:13.120
Iden: VZ-626.
